(1 row)

DROP SCHEMA sc CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 5 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to table sc.t
drop cascades to type sc.e
drop cascades to cast from sc.e to text
drop cascades to function sc.e_int(sc.e)
drop cascades to cast from sc.e to integer
SELECT length(dolt_commit('-Am', 'sc gone')::text) AS committed;
 committed 
-----------
        66
(1 row)

